.svelte-kit
build
.git

# Keep developer env files out of the build context. Vite loads .env.local even for a
# production build, so leaving them in made a local `docker build` silently differ from
# CI (which checks out from git, where they do not exist) and let local values reach the
# bundle. Only .env.build belongs here — the Dockerfile copies it to .env.production.
.env*
!.env.build

*.log